        "section": "body",
        "sentence_id": "p2_s3"
      },
      "text": "The first actor group, known as Advanced Persistent Threat (APT) 29, entered into the party’s systems in summer 2015, while the second, known as APT28, entered in spring 2016.",
      "language": "en",
      "confidence": 0.95,
      "note": "narrative sentence evidence",
